    <div class="tab" data-group="primary" data-tab="senjutsu"><section class="sns-senjutsu-panel">
      <h2>SENJUTSU (SAGE TECHNIQUE)</h2>
      <p><strong>Restricted supplementary power.</strong> Requires Vigor 14 and a qualifying Kuchiyose or Mokuton route. Each card lists its further prerequisites. This reference does not purchase powers, activate Sage Mode, create clones or grant bonuses.</p>
      {{#if senjutsuError}}<p role="alert">{{senjutsuError}} Reopen the sheet to retry. Confirm the full English system update is installed.</p>{{/if}}
      {{#if senjutsuStats}}<p><strong>Owned Senjutsu level:</strong> {{senjutsuStats.powerLevel}} · <strong>Sage Chakra capacity:</strong> {{senjutsuStats.pool}} · Vigor {{senjutsuStats.vigor}}. {{#if senjutsuStats.vigorMet}}Vigor 14 prerequisite met; check your qualifying route separately.{{else}}Vigor 14 prerequisite is not met.{{/if}}</p>{{else}}<p>No purchased Senjutsu power was detected. The full reference remains readable.</p>{{/if}}
      <p>Level filters show entries at that threshold. General bonuses and recharge options are under Level 1; additional prerequisites still apply. Every level lists its Sage Chakra capacity.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><label>Level <select data-senjutsu-filter="level"><option value="">All levels</option><option value="0">Core rules</option>{{#each senjutsuGroups}}<option value="{{level}}">Level {{level}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Category <select data-senjutsu-filter="kind"><option value="">All categories</option><option>Rules</option><option>Benefit</option><option>Recharge</option><option>Technique</option><option>Milestone</option></select></label><label>Search <input type="search" data-senjutsu-filter="query" placeholder="Find a Sage Mode rule"></label></div>
      <section class="sns-senjutsu-group"><h3>Core Senjutsu Rules</h3>{{#each senjutsuRules}}<details class="sns-senjutsu-entry sns-box" data-senjutsu-level="0" data-senjutsu-kind="{{kind}}" style="margin:8px 0;padding:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold">{{name}}</summary><p style="white-space:pre-line">{{description}}</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> {{cost}} · <strong>Action:</strong> {{action}}</p><small>Basic Book, pp. {{pageText}}</small></details>{{/each}}</section>
      {{#each senjutsuGroups}}<section class="sns-senjutsu-group"><h3>Level {{level}}</h3>{{#each entries}}<details class="sns-senjutsu-entry sns-box" data-senjutsu-level="{{level}}" data-senjutsu-kind="{{kind}}" style="margin:8px 0;padding:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold">{{name}} — {{kind}}</summary><p style="white-space:pre-line">{{description}}</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> {{cost}} · <strong>Action:</strong> {{action}}</p><small>Basic Book, pp. {{pageText}}</small></details>{{/each}}</section>{{/each}}
      <p>Track Sage Chakra, turns, once-per-scene bonuses and Sage Mode activation manually. Two Lives, clones, reverse summoning and recharge methods require their listed prerequisites and normal action rules.</p>
    </section></div>
